error: the new text that `replaceAll` gives is not used: it leaves `doc.body` as it was
  --> error_replace_all_unused_field.sg:7:5
 7 |     doc.body.replaceAll("draft", "final")
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  hint: to change `doc.body`, assign the new text to it: `doc.body = doc.body.replaceAll("draft", "final")`
